{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411210","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1541121001:1":{"text":"Nazrik, what are you studying?","source_cn":"那非，你在研究什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE0B2DE74A9F3C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541121002:1":{"text":"Something called a \"crossbow.\" A Halian weapon.","source_cn":"呼临人的武器，一个叫“弩”的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B88F8A4052E1F61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1541121002":{"text":"Something called a \"crossbow.\" A Halian weapon.","source_cn":"呼临人的武器，一个叫“弩”的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B88F8A4052E1F61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1541121004:1":{"text":"Before my disguise magic wore off, I traded a bag of jungle berries for it.","source_cn":"趁着伪装魔法尚未失效，我用一袋丛雨林浆果和呼临人换来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B2A7996E5CE30B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541121005:1":{"text":"They were desperate enough to give up a weapon just for food.","source_cn":"他们连宝贵的武器都可以拿来交换食物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7465F1A3C9497BC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1541121006:1":{"text":"Guess that famine in Halia still isn't over.","source_cn":"毕竟，呼临城的饥荒还没有解决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99C778905A6C3D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541121007:1":{"text":"So... what's special about this crossbow?","source_cn":"这些……弩，有什么特殊吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16111FFF1625188F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541121008:1":{"text":"Made of solid wood but light as a feather. About the same weight as our lightest shortbows.","source_cn":"它很轻，是用结实的木料制成的，重量却和雅库伯尔最轻最柔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB835951780E5D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541121009:1":{"text":"Yet packs a much meaner punch.","source_cn":"而且，它的杀伤力远远超过短弓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC950F54065B8CB78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541121010:0":{"text":"With sharp enough bolts, at close range, it could rival the force of a war axe or a spear.","source_cn":"若是配上足够锋利的箭，在短程之内，它的威力未必会比巨斧...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55483FB1CA3598AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1541121011:1":{"text":"Didn't expect Halian weapons to be so strong.","source_cn":"呼临人的武器，居然这么强大？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD21FBD44241CBE39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541121012:1":{"text":"It's not just strength. It's clever design. You can hide one across your back, and most enemies wouldn't even notice until it's too late.","source_cn":"与其说是强大，不如说，它足够精巧。可以藏在背后，不会轻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA45258A0142A077","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541121013:1":{"text":"Thanks to its light build, even the weakest of the Wildborn could handle it without trouble.","source_cn":"以它的重量和构造，即便是最瘦弱的雅库伯尔人也能轻松携带...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99A1D3E5C6824F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541121014:1":{"text":"You should try it.","source_cn":"你可以试试。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EA087DF127BCAA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541121015:1":{"text":"No need. Merlin and Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> both said my magic is weapon enough.","source_cn":"我不需要。梅林和<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23D3DCAFFFCB13DA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No need. Merlin and Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> both said my magic is weapon enough.","female":"No need. Merlin and Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> both said my magic is weapon enough.","variant_male_record_index":"186777","variant_female_record_index":"186778","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1541121016:1":{"text":"Suit yourself.","source_cn":"随你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA23305A95607CD14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1541121017:0":{"text":"Still, I'm taking this crossbow back to the craftsmen in Wrathwood Grove.","source_cn":"我会将这把弩带回树怒山谷，交给工匠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BD59D661078E9CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1541121018:0":{"text":"Hopefully, they can make something similar. Might give our warriors the edge, whether they're dealing with beasts or Halians.","source_cn":"但愿他们能仿照着做出类似的武器，这能提高战士的作战能力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78CFE5550D14F24B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"Where'd you get one?","source_cn":"你从哪里弄来的？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5D3B3272